# Thank-you pages — real static pages (200, not the SPA shell) so advertisers
# and leads never bounce to the homepage or a dead end.
# NOTE: served by Cloudflare Pretty URLs — `thank-you.html` auto-resolves at the
# extensionless `/thank-you` (same as sherpacarta.org). Do NOT add
# `/thank-you /thank-you.html 200` rewrites: they collide with Pretty-URL
# .html-stripping into a self-308 loop (verified 2026-09-13).

# Canonical www → non-www
https://www.tadbuy.giveabit.io/*   https://tadbuy.giveabit.io/:splat   301

